Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.96,0:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every\Nwall that's in our wake!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world\Nbelieving that surely someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.46,0:01:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Way up high! Always step up. If\Nwaves erupt up to the sky, never
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,give up our wishes they will come\Ntogether and lead us on for the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,future we drift on riding the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.18,0:01:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,waves towards another shore day by
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.30,0:01:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,day there are many meetings many
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,goodbyes underneath the flag we fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the pain within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep it in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.94,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.94,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:01:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.28,0:02:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.88,0:02:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up, way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if waves are\Nrough, jump through the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes,\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.72,0:02:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on towards our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey soldiers of Punk\NHazard, please listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're watching from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.18,0:02:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to know you're all being fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.82,0:02:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar has told you nothing but lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.98,0:02:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If you stay here, you're all going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.02,0:02:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the Straw Hats brainwash\Nhim after he was captured?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.22,0:02:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like he's on\Nthe level just below us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.78,0:02:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Building a hard first floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If everything goes\Naccording to plan, Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.68,0:02:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hats and the Navy\Nwill arrive there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.46,0:03:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should tell him to come up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me out and I'll tell\Nyou the truth about Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.60,0:03:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.52,0:03:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go speak with him myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, then we'll come with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.64,0:03:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear underling Brownbeard has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in quite a mood today, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want my people back, Caesar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.06,0:03:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We were ambushed by the pirates\Nat the center of the island,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but my men weren't killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They should have returned here by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to be crazy\Nyelling at the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.22,0:03:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.13,0:03:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, master! What? Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.48,0:03:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you brownbeard's people?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.44,0:03:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There are navy men at the main entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The way in is blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.34,0:03:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't get inside the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help us, master. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.90,0:03:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.20,0:03:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.49,0:04:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew we could count on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.50,0:04:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you going to let them in, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Lizzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of the dead will\Nswallow them up soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.68,0:04:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while since I heard from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and I haven't seen them in the laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.76,0:04:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on—they're not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, then\Nthey must be how awful,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,poor Brownbeard—all of your men lost to\Nthe land of the dead, and yet here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.94,0:04:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm gonna\Ntrust anything you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.88,0:04:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong has.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.98,0:04:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,wrong has Brownbeard\Ntotally lost his mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have if he's attacking the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been on this island\Ntogether for two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.58,0:04:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you should all leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar's not the man you thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to know what he\Ncalls you behind your backs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.40,0:04:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I can tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a special name for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.78,0:04:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He calls you Goody Pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.72,0:04:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Conney Pa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.16,0:04:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.10,0:05:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,J-Genie Po.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.88,0:05:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.79,0:05:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Guido pox, guinea pigs, guinea pox.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.06,0:05:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.76,0:05:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a different language?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.26,0:05:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fun to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.62,0:05:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Guido pox, guinea pox.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.24,0:05:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All the little fools who\Ncouldn't make it in the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.70,0:05:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,new world will keep\Nworshipping me as their savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.90,0:05:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I only keep them around as my guinea\Npigs just waiting for their turn to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Guinea pigs, guinea pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why isn't it coming out right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He did something to me, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.74,0:05:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up with you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a pretty elaborate prank!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.36,0:05:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably the muscle relaxer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.70,0:06:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem so tense, I thought you\Ncould use a little something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I do know what happened to them, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.66,0:06:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I let them die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.96,0:06:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.64,0:06:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And now before we lose\Nyou completely, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,is one more thing that\Ni think you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm sure you're familiar with the chemical
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,explosion that devastated\Nthis island four.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,years ago nearly killing all of these men
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.06,0:06:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but what you don't know\Nis that i was the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,responsible the explosion wasn't\Nvega pug's fault this monster
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.48,0:06:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,hurt all these men and then Passed\Nhimself off as their savior?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop attacking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.76,0:07:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some help here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.74,0:07:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I think Brownbeard's gone out of his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that's happened on this\Nisland is part of Caesar's sick plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out while there's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.24,0:07:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's no savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.34,0:07:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a demon disguised as a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how you treat\Nthe man who saved you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.44,0:07:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to hurt someone\Nif we don't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.50,0:07:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat must have done\Nsomething to turn him against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I'll finish him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.74,0:07:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a net!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.76,0:07:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:07:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It almost got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe everything to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,His kindness saved my life\Nas it saved others before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.30,0:08:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk was an evil man,\Nbut the Master is our savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Return to the second floor, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.96,0:08:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of the Straw Hats and\Nthe Navy Fools will be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.22,0:08:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.66,0:08:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.57,0:08:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready the broadcast for the brokers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at any rate, I'm sure they'll\Nall die off in about five years or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully, no one will catch on\Nand we can bring in a new batch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.84,0:08:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It was he!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:08:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the vile fiend!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.36,0:09:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who spoke of harming the children!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He is an evil man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.58,0:09:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How many people have you tricked\Ninto coming to Punk Hazard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your game?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.26,0:09:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You have your speculations,\Nbut clearly you know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.74,0:09:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I tell you the island's secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Straw Hat, you see this\Nisland is much like gas or air.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It exists, but it's invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.42,0:09:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What place could be more suitable for\Nthe work of an underground community?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.16,0:09:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the epicenter of black science.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.78,0:09:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I can perform all the\Nforbidden experiments. I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.98,0:09:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,want and gather test subjects\Nby any means necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have backers in high places who are more
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,than happy to sweep any\Nmisdeeds under the rug.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So the rest of the\Nworld remains oblivious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:09:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream as loud as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.34,0:09:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry a river of tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.98,0:10:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will come to the rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.32,0:10:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,For all your bluster,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.68,0:10:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't know a damn thing about\Nthis island and its dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.56,0:10:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.47,0:10:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Be smart and don't\Ninvolve yourself further.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.90,0:10:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're signing your own\Ndeath sentence, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.88,0:10:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Allying with Law was a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,His objective is to get\Nhis hands on S .A .D.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.18,0:10:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he's having you kidnap me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,because he knows I'm the only\Nperson who can create it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.92,0:10:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I produce it here and ship it\Noff to Don Quixote do Flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.84,0:10:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, the world's\Nmost dangerous warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.96,0:10:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He owns a factory in which S .A .D.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.12,0:10:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,is processed into Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Smile is a man-made\NDevil Fruit of the Snow variety.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.78,0:10:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who seeks power\Nyearns for such a fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.68,0:10:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo capitalizes on this desire by
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,selling smiles to major\Nplayers in the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.18,0:10:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,From what I hear,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.62,0:10:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,one of the Four Emperors\Nhas already begun using
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile to create a personal\Narmy of Devil Fruit eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it just send a\Nchill down your spine?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So are you beginning to understand\Nwhat you're dealing with now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.10,0:11:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just by coming here, you've\Ninterfered with Doflamingo's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That will anger a great many powerful\Npeople, ones you don't want to cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They will act, and when they do, it\Nwill shake the world to its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.62,0:11:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That chaos is just what law is after.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're both fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.52,0:11:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,These people are out of your league!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're playing with fire, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirororororo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.23,0:11:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture me if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.44,0:11:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm well protected, Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The four emperors!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, do you truly have the guts\Nto pick a fight with them? Psst!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.92,0:11:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-a-a-a-a-a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-a-a-a-a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.75,0:11:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-a-a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-a-a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.57,0:11:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.49,0:11:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.04,0:11:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-a!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.56,0:12:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You broke my nose! This hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.42,0:12:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you, you little brat! Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.06,0:12:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you listening to\Na single word I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.76,0:12:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no chance in hell you're\Ngoing to get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.24,0:12:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you who I have backing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The craziest pirate of them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to face a deadly\Nwarlord like Don Quixote Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.28,0:12:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the New World Puppeteer, the one who\Npulls all the strings behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.32,0:12:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Weapons, drugs, you name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's an illicit transaction\Ntaking place, he's involved somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.80,0:12:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the mastermind of the Underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.00,0:12:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,with connections to every\Nnotorious person you can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.90,0:12:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too late, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.34,0:12:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still spare you\Nif you apologize now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to do\Nsomething you'll regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.40,0:12:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Think carefully about this, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.78,0:13:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to pit yourself against\Nthe monsters I've got in my corner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Gas-steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.18,0:13:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You lost your chance, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.96,0:13:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A gas-burner attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Those melt steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.94,0:13:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he melt away or burn into ash?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.74,0:13:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a lot to process.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still a rookie in the new world, so\NI'm sure none of this feels real to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But one of those monsters\Nis right here in the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.86,0:13:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Vergo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.42,0:13:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody can stand for long\Nagainst his armament Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all gonners.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoke around that fool, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.16,0:13:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.84,0:13:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.36,0:14:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of the dead is a lethal gas that\Npetrifies any human before it kills them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.04,0:14:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It has covered the island and\Nis now filling the laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were headed in the right direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.24,0:14:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,we should have caught up\Nwith the kids already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.91,0:14:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your strength and shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.40,0:14:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need your directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, you went too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.76,0:14:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you mess up something this simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.48,0:14:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.20,0:14:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hurry, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My head feels all foggy, like\NI just came out of a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.60,0:14:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's a side effect\Nof the Saturday Dibs,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.50,0:14:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,but I assure you they're\Nperfectly harmless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The survivors are making their way\Ntoward the first floor of Building On,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,the location of the last remaining exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.68,0:14:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and ground zero for\NLuffy's battle with Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Kin'emon continues\Nhis desperate search for his son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:14:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What have I done to my poor Mobunosuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.18,0:15:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mobunosuke has taken the form of a dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.20,0:15:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.48,0:15:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is life truly so cruel?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.64,0:15:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I take my blade to\Nthe body of my own kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.94,0:15:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mobunosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the vilest monster that ever lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.64,0:15:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to please\Nlisten, you can't go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.76,0:15:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That area is surely\Nfilled with gas by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's with the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.46,0:15:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this always happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.88,0:16:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you satisfied now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.82,0:16:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to die here\Nalong with the rest law.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.32,0:16:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This past time to give up, smoker?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been over this, you\Nknow—you're no match for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.98,0:16:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,are you doing, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.82,0:17:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,call,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.35,0:17:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,spreading yourself thin—you shouldn't do
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,that when you're up against a better Haki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It just
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,makes it easier to hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.78,0:17:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you keep using your devil food power?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not thinking straight right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.24,0:17:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,like you—you always have\Nyour head in the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.06,0:17:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,in the game
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Demon Bamboo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to kill me so badly\Nfor betraying you and the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.12,0:18:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was stupid to take me on\Nwhen you're not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.56,0:18:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Recklessness won't save your\Npeople or make them proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Smoker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.94,0:18:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take things from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.28,0:18:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for keeping your end of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I get it, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.74,0:18:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This makes us even. Law will\Nyou finish him already you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.08,0:18:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,really can't stand the idea\Nof owing a pirate can you it's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.02,0:18:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,unworthy of a marine i'm just\Nglad my people aren't here
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.02,0:18:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to see this and yet i'm only\Nalive because of what you did
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.98,0:18:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's time to end this, Mr. Fire
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.86,0:18:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,pathetic fool it's about time you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,remember your place in the world\Ntell yourself whatever lies you need
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.78,0:19:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,to hear but i don't think you're\Ngonna be sitting on the throne of
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.72,0:19:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,power forever either of you yeah i\Nknow you're listening hello joker
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.54,0:19:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you should know that\NVergo is as good as dead
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to lose your right-hand man
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.28,0:19:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Straw Hat's\Ngonna take care of Caesar
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.10,0:19:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And that means you can kiss\Nyour supply of S .A .D.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.18,0:19:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't see this coming\Nbecause you were overconfident.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You always have been.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.00,0:19:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So please,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,feel free to keep cackling like an arrogant\Nidiot while you plot your next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.04,0:19:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy it while you can, but you won't\Nbe laughing for very much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.74,0:19:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we're gonna do the unthinkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You do a pretty decent job of\Nacting like a tough guy, runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.04,0:20:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think you're the one\Nwho's being overconfident here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look at Vergo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.86,0:20:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,pissing him off is never a good idea
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.74,0:20:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about what happened last time, how.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.46,0:20:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,did that turn out for you not very well\Nyou crossed vergo and what did he do
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,to you then you remember i'm sure it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.86,0:20:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,was quite dramatic are you afraid of him
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.72,0:20:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be even with your incomparable\Nswordsmanship with his Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,he can block your every attack, whether\Nwe're talking status or strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The sad fact is you're no match\Nfor Vergo, and never will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been two years now\Nsince the war in Marineford.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, did anyone actually\Naccomplish anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.56,0:21:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,All you did was maintain the status quo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And Whitebeard, all he did\Nwas bring an end to the era.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.60,0:21:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The navy regrouped and\Nbolstered its strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But none of the big\Nplayers have taken action.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like everyone has\Nbeen holding their breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.52,0:21:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just preparing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.70,0:21:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That war was only a beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.52,0:21:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a prologue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You always told me that it was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That a new era would arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.58,0:22:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Born along by an unstoppable\Ntide, the age of the Daring Ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.66,0:22:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are, Joker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.72,0:22:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.50,0:22:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The gears are broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.48,0:22:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no turning back for anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.02,0:22:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You
